text = "Ashes – Privacy Notice
Effective Date: December 1, 2025 

This game may be played completely offline. When played offline, no personal information is collected or transmitted, and only your game progress (e.g., level, score, in-game stats) is saved locally on your device.

If you choose to sign in with Google, we will access limited information from your Google account only for the purpose of saving your game progress online and restoring it on other devices.

Data We Collect When You Use Google Login

Google User ID

Google Account Email

Display Profile Photo

Cloud save file data (your game progress only)

Purpose of Collection

To enable cloud save and restore game progress across devices

To verify that the save data belongs to your account

Data Storage and Security

Offline save: stored locally in device files

Online save: stored via Supabase (secured storage)

All online communication is encrypted via HTTPS/TLS

We do not share, sell, or use your data for marketing

Your Rights

At any time, you can:

Play without logging in (offline mode)

Withdraw your consent by unlinking your account

Request deletion of your cloud-saved data via email

Contact

For data-related concerns:
destoque..k12151881@umak.edu.ph

If you do not agree to this policy, you may play offline but will not be able to use cloud save features.

🔹 By clicking \"I Agree,” you confirm you have read and understood this Privacy Notice."
vertical_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

