text = "Ashes – Terms & Conditions
Last Updated: December 1, 2025

These Terms govern your use of this game. Please read them carefully before playing.

1. License to Use

You are granted a personal, limited, non-commercial license to play this game. You may not modify, reverse engineer, redistribute, or exploit the game content beyond normal gameplay use.

2. Game Usage

The game may be played offline or with optional Google login.

Do not attempt to manipulate cloud data, cheat, bypass game mechanics, or interfere with the normal operation of the game.

3. Cloud Save Feature

If you choose to log in using Google:

Your gameplay progress will be uploaded and linked to your Google account.

Do not use an account that does not belong to you.

You are responsible for securing your Google login and understanding cloud-save risks.

4. Intellectual Property

The game programming/code is the exclusive property of [Developer Name].

Other assets used in the game (such as graphics, audio, effects, or fonts) were obtained from opensource, royalty-free, or licensed creators (e.g., via itch.io or other free-use platforms).

All such external assets remain the property of their respective creators and are used under the licenses provided by them.

You may not claim ownership, extract, resell, or redistribute any part of the game or its assets, whether created by the developer or sourced from third-party creators.

5. No Warranty and Limitation of Liability

This game is provided “as is” without guarantees of performance or compatibility.
We are not responsible for loss of data, technical issues, or damages arising from gameplay to the maximum extent permitted by law in the Philippines.
(Note: Limitations do not apply in cases of fraud or gross negligence.)

6. Governing Law

These Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of the Philippines. Any dispute shall be settled through the appropriate legal process under Philippine jurisdiction.

7. Updates and Modifications

These Terms may be updated occasionally. If changes are made, you will be informed, and continued use of the game indicates acceptance of the updated Terms.

🔹 By clicking “I Agree”, you confirm that you have read, understood, and accept these Terms & Conditions."
