text = "Connect Google Account
Signing in will allow your game progress to be safely stored online and accessible on other devices.

Information We Will Access

By continuing with Google Login, you agree that this game will access:
✔ Your Google Account Email – to identify your account and sync progress
✔ Your Google User ID – to securely store and retrieve cloud save data
✔ Your Google Profile Picture – only to display as your in-game avatar or account icon (e.g., circular profile image).

Your profile photo is used for display only and is not used for analytics, shared with others, or used outside the game.

Purpose of Data Use

To save and restore gameplay progress across devices (cloud save)

To personalize your account by displaying your Google profile picture in your profile/settings menu

To ensure that cloud save data belongs to your account

Your Choices

You may continue playing without Google login (offline mode)

You may unlink your account or delete cloud data anytime in Settings

Cloud save functionality will not work without Google login

All online communication is encrypted via HTTPS/TLS. We do not request access to your contacts, messages, or any other unrelated data.

🔹 By clicking “Continue”, you provide specific consent for your email, user ID, and (optional) profile photo to be processed for cloud save and account display purposes only.

🔹 If you do not wish to proceed, click “Cancel” to remain offline."
vertical_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

